@startuml
!include https://static.visual-paradigm.com/web/resources/plantuml-stdlib/themes/vp.puml

title Shipment - Update Shipment Status

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam activityFontName Arial
skinparam activityFontSize 14
skinparam activityBorderThickness 1.5
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam ArrowColor #222222
skinparam SwimlaneBorderColor #222222
skinparam SwimlaneBorderThickness 2
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #7DD3FC
  BorderColor #2563EB
  DiamondBackgroundColor #7DD3FC
  DiamondBorderColor #2563EB
  StartColor #111827
  EndColor #FFFFFF
}

|Seller|
start
note right
Precondition:
The seller is signed in and approved.

Postcondition:
SHIPPED stores the tracking code. DELIVERED: if every
non-cancelled line is delivered the order is DELIVERED
and COD completes. RETURNED restores the stock, FAILED
does not. CANCELLED cancels the lines, restores the
stock and recomputes the total.
end note
:Choose a shipment and a new status, with a tracking code for SHIPPED;
:Submit the update;
|System|
if (The system fails while processing the request?) then (Yes)
  :Return the system error;
  |Seller|
  :View the system error;
  stop
else (No)
endif
|System|
:Check the shipment is the seller's and the transition is allowed;
if (The transition is not allowed, the tracking code is missing, or the order is paid and the status is CANCELLED?) then (Yes)
  :Return the transition error;
  |Seller|
  :View the message;
  stop
else (No)
endif
|System|
if (The shipment is unknown or another seller's?) then (Yes)
  :Return the error;
  |Seller|
  :View the message;
  stop
else (No)
endif
|System|
:Save the new status;
:Apply the effects on the order, payment and stock for the new status;
|Seller|
:View the result;
stop

@enduml
